{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_title", "source_sha256": "8db1c74168e3a64d4e446554d67b0ecd0052eb70cdaa277c98ca1d7f9a5798c8", "ja": "歌織とおでかけ1", "zh": "和歌织外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "179b949137c6a90802d0be25bd3df3c363a059b3642bbb7c97aa59961c64ef95", "ja": "歌織とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和歌织外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4844d60ac5e6587bf4bf0e8bba6072cb9b5cdb60a722bbd6ea309e73c6f80b45", "ja": "おはようございます、歌織さん。\n……もしかして、寝不足ですか？", "zh": "早上好，歌织。\n……难道说，你没睡够吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1001_052kao", "source_sha256": "86ddfbe61b8172bedd982191ee730d7a39bcfec259fc239295035dac262a3395", "ja": "{$P$}さん、すみません、\n昨晩は、なかなか眠れなくて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，不好意思，\n昨晚我怎么也睡不着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "b550da302e2e7a3dd2728401dd83794b418fdfd36377eaf030e7ff61836aa8c5", "ja": "こんなふうに、ツアーで地方を回るなんて\n初めてのことですから。ドキドキしてしまって……。", "zh": "因为像这样跟着巡演到各地奔波，还是第一次嘛。不由得有些紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "e78efe001ac02e72dd885cb0825f7c29ae865a496cbfa780e1a7afde708ed1c4", "ja": "もう大人なのに……しっかりしなくちゃですよね。", "zh": "明明已经是个大人了……真该打起精神来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b3919326cfa177c6189cb7332a317636c330450497c5f6dd2e70284446510102", "ja": "そんなことありませんよ。\nそれに、ツアーは何が起こるかわかりませんから……。", "zh": "没那回事。\n而且，巡演途中会发生什么也说不准……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "772a9563c32d6a21f5668db5154414e6f496d2aaeddc9fe73c9c754ea81e4779", "ja": "きっと何度経験しても、ドキドキすると思います！\n俺も、同じですから。", "zh": "我想无论经历多少次，肯定还是会紧张得心怦怦跳！\n我也是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "7bec4a3041a474da3eee937a41059ba5a93bde219479adc4b56bd36518e69f18", "ja": "何が起こるかわからない……\n{$P$}さんでも、そうなんですね。", "zh": "不知道会发生什么……就连{$P$}先生，也是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7a8d84e4c2b19bddddde0bcba28071a2e3abbe2db55f0eb8348f2892017193d9", "ja": "はい。だから、なんでも話してください！\n不安も緊張も、共有しましょう！", "zh": "是的。所以，请把什么都告诉我吧！\n无论是不安还是紧张，都一起分享吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "f7d1a52419b73cb9c0292db20a1de0f21ed7a9117cf1610651666d413f9ce646", "ja": "不思議……なんだか、不安が\nすっと解けていってしまったみたい。", "zh": "好奇怪……总觉得，不安似乎一下子就消散了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_052kao01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_052kao01_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "9201c7a45fff4399ce782ad08c398474685b059b26bc65f992e97aa4b94b9012", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\n私、なんだかがんばれそうです♪", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生。\n我总觉得能好好加油了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
